    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>After a shipwreck, you are one of the survivors. <br><br>You make it to land, but soon discover that you are not welcome.<br> <br>To survive, you will have to build a base for your own protection. <br><br>The ship got stuck in the water and many boxes with things inside were floating in the sea.<br><br>The tides will start to go down, and new little islands will pop up with stuff to gather. <br><br>To avoid the dangers of the sea, such as sharks, you will have to build a raft to be able to explore the islands that will appear when the tide goes down.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important Disclaimer:.</strong></h2>I am a solo developer working hard to get the game out, but it's important to mention that many features aren't there yet.<br>I want to develop the game further based on Early adopters feedback and implement your ideas to the game",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>After a shipwreck, you are one of the survivors. <br><br>You make it to land, but soon discover that you are not welcome.<br> <br>To survive, you will have to build a base for your own protection. <br><br>The ship got stuck in the water and many boxes with things inside were floating in the sea.<br><br>The tides will start to go down, and new little islands will pop up with stuff to gather. <br><br>To avoid the dangers of the sea, such as sharks, you will have to build a raft to be able to explore the islands that will appear when the tide goes down.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important Disclaimer:.</strong></h2>I am a solo developer working hard to get the game out, but it's important to mention that many features aren't there yet.<br>I want to develop the game further based on Early adopters feedback and implement your ideas to the game",
    "short_description": "After a shipwreck, you are one of the survivors. To Survive you will need to fight for your life.",
